Portions of this repository are derived from jq 1.8.1
(https://github.com/jqlang/jq):

  - src/prelude.jq mirrors jq's src/builtin.jq
  - tests/cases/upstream_*.txt are converted from jq's tests/*.test; the cases
    in upstream_man.txt come from the examples in jq's manual (docs/)

